Material Symbols
================

This directory holds icons from Material Symbols (https://github.com/marella/material-symbols),
version 0.48.3 of the npm package @material-symbols/svg-400 (upstream ref v0.48.3).
Copyright Google LLC (artwork) and the material-symbols contributors (packaging). Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; the
licence text is licenses/material-symbols/LICENSE, under this directory.

Upstream ships no NOTICE file at that ref. Checked 2026-11-04:
  - marella/material-symbols@v0.48.3/NOTICE (404)
  - google/material-design-icons@master/NOTICE (404)

Changes made by Simtabi LLC when the files were vendored into
ichava/icon-sets-material-symbols (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)):

  - Every SVG was passed through the icon-sets-sync SVG sanitiser (policy v2),
    which removes elements and attributes outside its allow list.
  - Files were renamed and moved into one directory per variant, as described
    in ATTRIBUTION.md and docs/architecture.md.
  - Only a subset of the upstream files is included (see ATTRIBUTION.md).

The drawings themselves were not edited.
